 "meta": {
  "id": "eea86f3959925fe08529d33a29f2d7f3",
  "name": {
   "zh": "3D 动画生成",
   "en": "3D Animation Generation"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "一张卡做完一段动作：不传参考帧，Kimodo 按文字生成；上传一段 FBX 动作当参考帧，就拿它的关键帧补出中间动作（文字可写可不写）。要用到自己的角色就打开「重定目标到我的角色」、上传角色 FBX、选重定目标方法（默认经典，也可以换 STaR / SATA / Kinematic Refinement / MeshRet），预处理全部自动、后处理不修正，结果蒙到你的角色上。交付 FBX 和 USD，文件名带方法名；关掉的分支整条不算。",
   "en": "One card for a whole motion: with no reference frames Kimodo generates from text; upload an FBX motion and it fills in between its keyframes. To use your own character, turn on Retarget to My Character, upload its FBX and pick a Retarget Method (Classic, STaR, SATA, Kinematic Refinement or MeshRet); pre-processing is automatic. Delivers FBX and USD named after the method; branches that are off are skipped."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-03T18:00:00",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T18:00:00",
  "deliverable": "workflow",
  "owner": "admin",
  "own_interface": [
   "retarget"
  ]
 },
